        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Sayidaty, Closer, Hia, Al Jamila\n- People: Mai Badr\n- Companies: Bauer Media Group\n- Places: Dubai, Beirut, Middle East, North Africa, Europe, America\n- Roles: editor-in-chief, deputy editor-in-chief\n\nFacts:\n- Sayidaty is a women's magazine whose Arabic title means \"My Lady\" in English.\n- Sayidaty is published weekly in Arabic and monthly in English.\n- Sayidaty is published in Dubai and Beirut and is distributed throughout the Middle East, North Africa, Europe, and America.\n- Closer is a British tabloid magazine published by Bauer Media Group.\n- Mai Badr was born on 6 July 1968.\n- Mai Badr is the editor-in-chief of Hia magazine and the deputy editor-in-chief of Sayidaty and Al Jamila.",
